# setuptools_scm puts every git-tracked file in the source distribution, which sweeps in the
# pre-generated example figures. Those are 5.6 MB of PNG built for the documentation, they are
# regenerable with docs/scripts/generate_*_figs.py, and the wheel carries no documentation at
# all, so they inflate the sdist for no one's benefit. The example sources stay.
prune docs/source/_static/acoustic_source_figs
prune docs/source/_static/measured_data_figs
